<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Subscription Renewed Successfully</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #0F172A; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f7; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #047857 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .header .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .success-box { background: #ecfdf5; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; text-align: center; }
        .success-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .success-text { color: #047857; font-size: 14px; }
        .plan-card { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .plan-name { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .plan-price { font-size: 16px; color: #6b7280; }
        .plan-price span { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; }
        .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        .details-table td { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .details-table td:first-child { color: #6b7280; }
        .details-table td:last-child { text-align: right; font-weight: 500; }
        .features { margin: 20px 0; }
        .features h4 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #0F172A; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .features ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }
        .features li { padding: 8px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 14px; }
        .features li:before { content: "✓"; color: #059669; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 10px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #85182F; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .btn-secondary { background: #ffffff; color: #85182F !important; border: 2px solid #85182F; }
        .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
        .footer a { color: #85182F; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">🎉</div>
            <h1>Subscription Renewed</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
            
            <div class="success-box">
                <div class="success-title">Your subscription has been renewed!</div>
                <div class="success-text">Thank you for continuing with us.</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="plan-card">
                <div class="plan-name">{{planName}}</div>
                <div class="plan-price">
                    <span>{{currency}} {{amount}}</span>/{{billingInterval}}
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <table class="details-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Renewal Date</td>
                    <td>{{renewalDate}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Next Billing Date</td>
                    <td>{{nextBillingDate}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Billing Period</td>
                    <td>{{billingPeriodStart}} - {{billingPeriodEnd}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Payment Method</td>
                    <td>{{paymentMethod}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            
            {{#if features}}
            <div class="features">
                <h4>Your plan includes:</h4>
                <ul>
                    {{#each features}}
                    <li>{{this}}</li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Go to Dashboard</a>
                <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}" class="btn btn-secondary">Manage Subscription</a>
            </p>
            
            <p>We're thrilled to have you with us for another billing period. If you have any questions or need assistance, our team is always here to help.</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>{{companyName}} • {{companyAddress}}</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}">Billing Portal</a> • 
                <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Support</a> • 
                <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Email Preferences</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

